{
  "name": "Build a weekly list of newly funded startups in your market with Alion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly list of newly funded startups\n\n### How it works\nEvery Monday this workflow asks Alion (a live graph of companies, their funding rounds and hiring) for startups in your market that announced a funding round recently. It keeps only the startups it has not saved before and adds them to an n8n Data Table, so the table grows into a deduplicated prospect or deal-flow list: name, domain, industry, size, country, founding year, last round and its date, and how many roles each startup is hiring for. Useful for sales teams prospecting freshly funded companies, recruiters, and investors tracking a sector.\n\nAlion is called through its free open MCP address, so no account or API key is needed. The free allowance is 300 calls a day per network and up to 20 companies per search.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open **Configure your market** and set the country, industry, funding stages and time window.\n2. Leave the Data Table name as is or change it: the workflow creates the table on the first run.\n3. Run the workflow once with **Execute workflow** and open the Data Table to check the rows.\n4. Activate the workflow to run it every Monday.\n\n### Customization\nAdd a Slack, Gmail or Google Sheets node after **Save new startups** to get the new names as a digest. Change the schedule, or widen the search in **Configure your market** (several funding stages or industries separated by commas).",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-640, -260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Settings\nWhen to run and which startups to look for.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Section: settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-120, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find recently funded startups\nCreates the Data Table on the first run, then searches Alion's open MCP address (no key) and returns one item per startup.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Section: search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [380, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save only new startups\nSkips domains already in the table, so each startup is saved once even when it stays in the results for weeks.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Section: save",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Every Monday at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-80, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "c1", "name": "country", "value": "DE", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c2", "name": "industry", "value": "Fintech", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c3", "name": "funding_stage", "value": "pre_seed,seed,series_a", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c4", "name": "raised_since", "value": "90d", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c5", "name": "max_results", "value": 20, "type": "number" },
            { "id": "c6", "name": "data_table", "value": "Funded startups (Alion)", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Configure your market",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [140, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "table",
        "operation": "create",
        "tableName": "={{ $json.data_table }}",
        "columns": {
          "column": [
            { "name": "domain", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "name", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "industry", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "country", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "size", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "founded_year", "type": "number" },
            { "name": "last_round", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "last_round_date", "type": "string" },
            { "name": "open_jobs", "type": "number" },
            { "name": "alion_id", "type": "number" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "createIfNotExists": true
        }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Create the table if missing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [420, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "endpointUrl": "https://alion.io/mcp/open",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "search_companies"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  country: $('Configure your market').item.json.country,\n  industry: $('Configure your market').item.json.industry,\n  startup: true,\n  funding_stage: $('Configure your market').item.json.funding_stage,\n  raised_since: $('Configure your market').item.json.raised_since,\n  sort: 'recent_funding',\n  detail: 'compact',\n  limit: $('Configure your market').item.json.max_results\n}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Search recently funded startups",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [640, 40],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "structuredContent.items",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "One item per startup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [860, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "rowNotExists",
        "dataTableId": {
